			"date": "2024-03-20T13:51:00.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> any chance of showing tweetback a bit more love? I'm like 1 issue away from replacing all my twitter links everywhere with tweetback links: <a href=\"https://github.com/tweetback/tweetback/issues/96\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">github.com/tweetback/tweetback</span><span class=\"invisible\">/issues/96</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112128482156627034",
			"parentId": "112128338252952986",
